 pve-manager (9.2.27) trixie; urgency=medium
 
   * ui: encode values from the API and other external sources before showing
     them, so that they cannot inject HTML into the web interface:
     - guest import wizard: all values taken from the import source, like the
       disk and network details read from an ESXi VMX file or an OVF.
     - Ceph service, monitor and OSD details, storage targets and the PBS
       encryption key fingerprint.
     - read-only display fields now show their value as plain text by
       default.
